  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n\r\n### Breaking Change\r\n* Deprecation of phind provider due to it being shutdown\r\n### Enhancements ✨\r\n* refactor: replace Phind with OpenRouter as the default AI provider by @muandane in https://github.com/muandane/goji/pull/132\r\n* add carapace integration by @N4CH723HR3R in https://github.com/muandane/goji/pull/130\r\n* remove double registered commands by @N4CH723HR3R in https://github.com/muandane/goji/pull/131\r\n### 👒 Dependencies\r\n* Bump codecov/codecov-action from 5.5.1 to 5.5.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/muandane/goji/pull/129\r\n* Bump github.com/spf13/cobra from 1.10.1 to 1.10.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/muandane/goji/pull/128\r\n* Bump actions/checkout from 5.0.0 to 6.0.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/muandane/goji/pull/127\r\n* Bump actions/setup-go from 6.0.0 to 6.1.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/muandane/goji/pull/125\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @N4CH723HR3R made their first contribution in https://github.com/muandane/goji/pull/130\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/muandane/goji/compare/v0.1.9...v0.2.0",
